{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev40116","label":"PROJECT MATIS · Part 1"},"label":"Cornered: A","stage":null,"prev":"event_projectmatis2_02_e","next":"event_projectmatis2_03_e","speakers":{"newsanchor":"News Anchor","maxwell_h":"Maxwell","syuen":"Syuen","jien":"Jien","manresearcher":"Male Researcher","womanresearcher":"Female Researcher"},"icons":{"newsanchor":"si_c999_00_s","maxwell_h":"si_c105_01_s","syuen":"si_c901_00_s","jien":"si_c973_00_s","manresearcher":"si_c999_00_s","womanresearcher":"si_c999_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"newsanchor","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_1","text":"Breaking news: Missilis Industry's Project Matis has succeeded in producing its first prototypes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Office","bgArt":"office","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_inark","movie":null,"shown":["syuen","maxwell_h"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"newsanchor","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_2","text":"Eight candidates among forty have received prototype bodies in the first round of production and have been deemed stable.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"newsanchor","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_3","text":"Missilis CEO Syuen announced the company would proceed with a second round of prototype bodies, with production beginning tomorrow afternoon.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"newsanchor","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_4","text":"It would appear the manufacturer is one step closer to the creation of a \"hero Nikke\"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_h","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_5","text":"What the...?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_h","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_6","text":"We barely made the prototype yesterday, and it's already in the news?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_7","text":"Yeah, looks like it. Everyone's pretty thrilled, apparently.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_h","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_8","text":"... Something's off. Don't you find it weird how so many details are getting leaked?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_9","text":"So what?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_10","text":"Someone was probably just eager to get the good news out.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_11","text":"If the PR team wants to put in the work, let them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_h","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_12","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_h","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_13","text":"Yeah, I guess we've got more important things to think about anyway.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_h","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_14","text":"As the report said, all those who received bodies in the first round are in good shape.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_h","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_15","text":"Their energy output isn't as high as we expected from the design,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_h","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_16","text":"but their physical capabilities are on an entirely different level than regular Nikkes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_h","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_17","text":"As for the energy output, I figure we can fine-tune it in the next phase by feeding in electrical energy.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_18","text":"Sounds great. Everything's going smoothly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_19","text":"We can kick off the second round of production as soon as the body...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_20","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_20","text":"*Bzzt*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_21","text":"Hmm? Who's messaging me all of a sudden...?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_22","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_22","text":"Syuen picks up her phone.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_23","text":"... Jien?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_24","text":"What do you want?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"event_bgm_pmatis_mdaughters","movie":null,"shown":["jien"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"jien","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_25","text":"What else? To congratulate you, of course.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"jien","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_26","text":"I heard you produced your very first Nikke bodies yesterday.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"jien","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_27","text":"How'd it go?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"jien","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_28","text":"Did they come out all right? Are you happy with them?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_29","text":"That's none of your business.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"jien","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_30","text":"That must mean it went well.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_31","text":"Seriously, what do you want?!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"jien","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_32","text":"Oh, don't be so angry.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"jien","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_33","text":"I just wanted to congratulate you... and to give you a little warning.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_34","text":"A warning...?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"jien","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_35","text":"Have you heard anything about what the board's up to?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_36","text":"Living their best lives? I don't know.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_37","text":"The project's going well. They can't have anything to say about it, right?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"jien","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_38","text":"Oh, but they do.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"jien","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_39","text":"They've got a lot to say, precisely because your project's going so well.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_40","text":"What's that supposed to mean?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"jien","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_41","text":"It means the more power the CEO has within Missilis Industry,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"jien","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_42","text":"the less influence the board has.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_43","text":"...!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"jien","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_44","text":"Back when Father was CEO, the suits didn't dare do anything,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"jien","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_45","text":"but ever since you took over, they've been running wild.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"jien","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_46","text":"You haven't been able to keep as tight of a grip on them as Father did.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_47","text":"I-it's not that I haven't been able to! I've just chosen not to!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"jien","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_48","text":"Oh, I'm sure. In any case, you haven't kept them under control.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"jien","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_49","text":"And with the recent dip in public opinion,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"jien","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_50","text":"they were going to use it as an excuse to rattle you and get a tighter hold on the company...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"jien","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_51","text":"But then you went and started a brand-new Nikke project.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_52","text":"... What are you trying to say?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"jien","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_53","text":"Well, I'm sure they didn't mind at first.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"jien","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_54","text":"Right? I mean, who'd think something you came up with as a kid would actually turn out well?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"jien","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_55","text":"Especially when the previous CEO wrote it off as nothing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"jien","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_56","text":"Their guard was down in the beginning,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"jien","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_57","text":"because no one actually thought your project would succeed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"jien","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_58","text":"To them, our father was both a devil and a god.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"jien","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_59","text":"But then, to the surprise of everyone, it worked.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"jien","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_60","text":"They thought you'd fail before making a single body, and yet it's going great.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis2_03_s_61","text":"Get to the point!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis2_03_s_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"jien","key":"Locale_MainScenario:eve